WEBVTT

00:15:58.731 --> 00:16:01.222
and went to work
as a consultant at Accenture.

00:16:01.246 --> 00:16:03.174
GA: I was really happy to join the firm.

00:16:03.198 --> 00:16:06.894
And I mean, it has only been
great experiences.

00:16:06.918 --> 00:16:08.879
AG: Gonzalo had accomplished a big goal,

00:16:08.903 --> 00:16:10.146
and for four years,

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.393
he helped companies grow
and perform better.

00:16:12.417 --> 00:16:15.914
But he had a nagging feeling
that something was missing from his life.

00:16:15.938 --> 00:16:18.068
GA: As soon as I got to Accenture,

00:16:18.092 --> 00:16:20.373
I wanted to give back to Latin America.

00:16:20.397 --> 00:16:23.738
That was kind of, like, my life objective.

00:16:23.762 --> 00:16:27.463
I saw that we had worked
with this microlending institution

00:16:27.487 --> 00:16:30.046
called Caja Arequipa,